---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="CODERMAN" description="Software Developer, AI software development, and technical writing.">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Software Developer</p>
    <h1>CODERMAN</h1>
    <p class="lead">AI 软件开发，Building things with code.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/blog/">阅读博客</a>
      <a class="button" href="#contact">联系我</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Focus</p>
      <h2 id="focus-title">技术方向</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="text-block">
      <p>关注软件工程、AI 辅助开发、工具链和个人知识管理。这里会整理项目经验、技术笔记和实践记录。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-grid" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
      <h2 id="contact-title">保持联系</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="text-block">
      <p>可以在后续补充 GitHub、邮箱、社交媒体或简历链接。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
